## Edgeware Community Web Developer Role: Jan Kraus

### **Date: 14th November 2022**

Author/Curator: Jan Kraus, Shankar Warang

Proposal type: Postpaid, Variable incentives proportional to the hours contributed


### **Summary**

Jan started his Edgeverse contribution journey along with Johan (ex-Designer) who introduced him to Edgeware. Since the decentralization of the Agency, Jan decided to continue the contributions to the Edgeware ecosystem as a part-time solo contributor. So this proposal aims to incentivize Jan's contributions from the start of June to the end of October this year.


### **Deliverables**

- Web development for Edgeware and all the Edgeverse projects
  - Several revision rounds of small fixes and adjustments for the website v3 launch (including the v3.0.1 update). {delivered}
  - Support & troubleshooting of live release of the website. {continuous}
  - Migrations to edgeware.io and redirects' setup. {delivered}
  - SEO optimizations. {continuous}
  - Interactive widgets development. {ongoing}
  - Onboarding new contributors. {continuous}

- Co-hosting weekly 'Design and Mission Planning' calls. {continuous}

- Helping other contributors occasionally with anything related to web interfaces/portals. {continuous}


### **Incentives**

Incentives per hour: 68 USD 

Total hours contributed from 1st June to 31st Oct 2022: 43

Total incentives: 2924 USD

Recipient's address: mTjWxK7EDHvr6VX2yQ4xUozhtB3TXEsq2CfzaTzvrAB3Naq

7-day trailing average: 0.0005

Total in EDG: 5848000

Opted for SCU: Yes {Upon approval of this proposal, Jan's monthly incentives for November and moving forward will be part of the next SCU proposal.}
